          "notes": "The source-visible title pages state Leipzig, C. G. Naumann, 1906 and 10. und 11. Tausend des Antichrist. The partial embodied-expression list records the currently identified Der Antichrist member. The Commons DjVu and Internet Archive DjVuXML derivative are separate Items of the same scan lineage; their correspondence is recorded at the examined structural anchors."
